# Zenith-AI — Cursor Rules

> Read AGENTS.md before doing any work.

## Project
Mode-based vault workspace Obsidian plugin with a self-hosted companion web app.

## Active Packages
- `packages/plugin` — Obsidian plugin (TypeScript, React, esbuild)
- `packages/web` — Self-hosted Next.js web app (Postgres/Drizzle, Docker standalone)

Only these two packages exist. Do not add, reference, or restore any other package. Do not add external auth, billing, analytics, cloud storage, or media processing without explicit instruction.

## Package Manager
pnpm only. Lockfile: pnpm-lock.yaml.

## Core rules
- Functional React components, hooks only
- tsx for React, ts for logic
- Named exports preferred
- No generation/sampling params in model configs
- After ANY deletion: run ./scripts/verify-deletion.sh — not done until it exits 0
